# catalog-service — F-01 skeleton
# Run the service first: cd catalog-service && ./mvnw spring-boot:run

### Ping — returns PingResponse(service, time)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ping

### Actuator health (liveness + readiness groups)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### F-02 — Create a venue (201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Le Zénith",
  "capacity": 6293,
  "address": {"street": "211 Avenue Jean Jaurès", "city": "Paris", "country": "France"}
}

### F-02 — Validation failure (400 ProblemDetail with errors[])
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ab",
  "capacity": 0,
  "address": {"street": "", "city": "Paris", "country": "France"}
}

### F-02 — Get a venue by id (200 / 404 ProblemDetail) — paste an id from the create response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/venues/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### F-02 — List venues by city, paged (case-insensitive; omit city for all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/venues?city=paris&page=0&size=20

### F-03 — Create a DRAFT event (201 + Location). Paste a venue id from the F-02 create response.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Concert",
  "description": "A night of music",
  "startsAt": "2027-06-01T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-06-01T22:00:00Z",
  "venueId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### F-03 — Unknown venue (404 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Concert",
  "startsAt": "2027-06-01T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-06-01T22:00:00Z",
  "venueId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### F-03 — Update title/description/dates (200). Paste an event id.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Concert (moved)",
  "description": "Now in the main hall",
  "startsAt": "2027-06-02T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-06-02T22:00:00Z"
}

### F-03 — Ends before it starts (422 ProblemDetail: business rule, not validation)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Concert",
  "startsAt": "2027-06-02T22:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-06-02T19:00:00Z"
}

### F-03 — Add a ticket tier (201, no Location; body is the whole event with tiers[]).
### maxPerBooking is optional and defaults to 8.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tiers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard",
  "price": {"amount": 49.90, "currency": "EUR"},
  "quantity": 6000
}

### F-03 — Tier that overshoots venue capacity (422 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tiers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "VIP",
  "price": {"amount": 149.00, "currency": "EUR"},
  "quantity": 1000,
  "maxPerBooking": 4
}

### F-03 — Tier validation failure (400 with nested price.* field errors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tiers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": {"amount": 1.999, "currency": "eur"},
  "quantity": 0
}

### F-03 — Get an event including its tiers (200 / 404 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### OpenAPI document (what Swagger UI renders)
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### Swagger UI (open in browser)
# http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
